msgid "100+ messages between agents"
msgstr "Más de 100 mensajes entre agentes"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Time format” saying what it does.
msgid "12- or 24-hour clock for message and chat-list times"
msgstr "Reloj de 12 o 24 horas para las horas de los mensajes y de la lista de chats"

#. Settings > Time format, an option: how times are written; keep the example time as it is
msgid "12-hour (6:10 PM)"
msgstr "12 horas (6:10 PM)"

#. Settings > Time format, an option: how times are written; keep the example time as it is
msgid "24-hour (18:10)"
msgstr "24 horas (18:10)"

#. Settings page and Ctrl+K, the line under the preference “Reply notifications” saying what it does.
msgid "A desktop notification when an agent answers in a chat that is not open"
msgstr ""
"Una notificación del escritorio cuando un agente responde en un chat que no está abierto"

#. Key-binding editor and keymap import, error: a double press must be the same key twice (e.g. Right Right); {} is what was typed
msgid "A double press is one key twice: {}"
msgstr "Una doble pulsación es la misma tecla dos veces: {}"

#. agent profile, error moving an agent: another move runs
