#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "High contrast" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible 18px, near-black on off-white. For bright rooms, glare and low-DPI screens."
msgstr ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible 18px, casi negro sobre blanco roto. Para habitaciones luminosas, reflejos y pantallas de baja densidad."

#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "Graphite" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible in off-white on warm charcoal, never pure black. Low glare for evenings and dim rooms."
msgstr ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible en blanco roto sobre carbón cálido, nunca negro puro. Pocos reflejos para la noche y las habitaciones con poca luz."

#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "Sepia" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible on warm sepia, for long reading by day. Brown-black text; status colours stay apart for colour-blind eyes."
msgstr ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible sobre sepia cálido, para leer mucho rato de día. Texto marrón oscuro; los colores de estado se distinguen bien con daltonismo."

#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "Hyperlegible" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible sans on the dark palette. Built for low vision and tired eyes."
msgstr ""
"Atkinson Hyperlegible sans sobre la paleta oscura. Pensado para baja visión y ojos cansados."

