"Optional shell command run when forgetting a Host's token (uses {url}, {host}, CLARP_SERVER_URL, CLARP_SERVER_HOST)"
msgstr ""
"Comando de shell opcional que se ejecuta al olvidar el token de un Host (usa {url}, {host}, CLARP_SERVER_URL, CLARP_SERVER_HOST)"

